{"id":"n3-102","title":"～てみる (〜te miru)","jlptLevel":3,"shortExplanation":"A grammar structure used to express the action of trying or attempting something to see what happens.","longExplanation":"The 〜てみる grammar point is used with a verb in the 〜て form followed by みる. It emphasizes doing something as a trial or to see the result. It often translates as 'to try doing something' or 'try it out'.","formation":"Verb-て form + みる","examples":[{"jp":"彼は走ってみたが、まだ膝が痛いと感じた。","romaji":"Kare wa hashitte mita ga, mada hiza ga itai to kanjita.","en":"He tried running, but he still felt pain in his knee.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"走っ","vocabId":"1402540","reading":"はしる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"み","vocabId":"1365520","reading":"み"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"まだ","vocabId":"1527110","reading":"まだ"},{"surface":"膝","vocabId":"1487320","reading":"ひざ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"痛い","vocabId":"1432680","reading":"いたい"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"感じ","vocabId":"1212250","reading":"かんじ"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"彼女は料理を作ってみたが、失敗してしまった。","romaji":"Kanojo wa ryouri o tsukutte mita ga, shippai shite shimatta.","en":"She tried cooking but ended up failing.","words":[{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"料理","vocabId":"1554310","reading":"りょうり"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"作っ","vocabId":"1597890","reading":"つくる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"み","vocabId":"1365520","reading":"み"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"失敗","vocabId":"1320140","reading":"しっぱい"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"しまっ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"初めてのデートで、彼は彼女にサプライズをしようと考え、歌ってみた。","romaji":"Hajimete no deeto de, kare wa kanojo ni sapuraizu o shiyou to kangae, utatte mita.","en":"On their first date, he thought of surprising her and tried singing.","words":[{"surface":"初めて","vocabId":"1342550","reading":"はじめて"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"デート","vocabId":null},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"サプライズ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"しよ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"う","vocabId":null},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"考え","vocabId":"1281000","reading":"かんがえ"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"歌っ","vocabId":"1588120","reading":"うたう"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"み","vocabId":"1365520","reading":"み"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"このケーキは美味しそうだから、味見に食べてみる。","romaji":"Kono keeki wa oishisou dakara, ajimi ni tabete miru.","en":"Since this cake looks delicious, I will try tasting it.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ケーキ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"美味し","vocabId":"1486650","reading":"おいしい"},{"surface":"そう","vocabId":"1399540","reading":"そう"},{"surface":"だ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"から","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"味見","vocabId":"1722300","reading":"あじみ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"食べ","vocabId":"1358280","reading":"たべる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"みる","vocabId":"1259290","reading":"みる"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]}]}